--- !u!114 &114740819046818532
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1380985932485985}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 282
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 不似你印象中凡俗婚礼的热闹，林家内只有十数个修士三两成群的交谈着，数十个侍从忙碌着，再就是大殿中几个你看不出修为深浅的前辈。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114838157294334658
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1380985932485985}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 408
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 天地间修仙者无数，能得偿所愿者又有几人？得之吾幸，失之亦吾命。且如今辞世千年，亲友不在，道侣弟子尽亡，老夫更是忘却孤身苦修是为何，又...嗯？有个神识异常强大的修士正在往这边来，择日再说吧。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 2
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
